The five Bundesrat plenary endpoints below have only the placeholder files <endpoint>.yaml today (see the card about the .yaml placeholders) - the CLI shows their answer as a raw YAML dump. The shapes of the XML answers were measured live on 2026-10-20 with view=renderXml, so the templates are built without an API call. This is the second half of the Bundesrat templates; the other five endpoints have their own card.

Measured shapes (parsed with the XML parser of the repo):
- bundesrat_plenum_kompakt: list.tops.top[] - nr, title, subtop, filter, bvgtext, bvgurl, imagePath, imageDate; in addition list.header (a hash)
- bundesrat_plenum_aktuelle_sitzung: list.top[] - toptitle, topheader, topdrucksache, topurl, linkedtop, topdetail; in addition list.header, list.sitzung, list.stand, list.title
- bundesrat_plenum_chronologisch: only scalars - list.header, list.title
- bundesrat_plenum_naechste_sitzungen: one base page - title, date, dateOfIssue, abstract, detail, imagePath, imageCaption, imageSource, imgDates, id, type
- bundesrat_stimmverteilung: one base page - title ("-"), imageCaption, imagePath, date, dateOfIssue, detail, abstract

The fields detail, bodyText, topdetail and abstract contain HTML and do not belong in a template.

Templates: one file <endpoint>.yml per endpoint in all seven languages (de, en, fr, es, it, nl, pl), in the style of the existing files (see share/templates/de/autobahn_closures.yml for the table, share/templates/de/bundesrat_drucksachen.yml for the record). The headers and labels are translated, the field names stay as the API delivers them.

| endpoint | type | extract | columns / fields |
|---|---|---|---|
| bundesrat_plenum_kompakt | table | list.tops.top | nr, title, subtop |
| bundesrat_plenum_aktuelle_sitzung | table | list.top | toptitle, topheader, topdrucksache, topurl |
| bundesrat_plenum_chronologisch | record | - | list.title, list.header |
| bundesrat_plenum_naechste_sitzungen | record | - | title, date, dateOfIssue, abstract |
| bundesrat_stimmverteilung | record | - | imageCaption, imagePath, date, dateOfIssue |

Every template carries a translated empty message that fits the endpoint (German: "Keine Tagesordnungspunkte.", "Keine Angaben." - with umlauts, in the language of the file).

Two answers hold more than the table can show, and that is deliberate: the session data of bundesrat_plenum_aktuelle_sitzung (list.sitzung, list.stand, list.header, list.title) and the header of bundesrat_plenum_kompakt (a hash with titel1, titel2, titel3, url) stay in the XML and are not shown. The table shows what one reads at the desk.

